From d3dd05299ff8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hemang Kumawat <HemangKumawat@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:59:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10] media: bring up five Coral cameras and concurrent rear and IR streams

Adopt licensed SM8150 camera drivers, Coral sensor routing and split IR PHY support. Apply a 150 MHz active CAMNOC floor while preserving errors and higher rates. Exact installed image passed sustained capture and daily regression checks with the separately classified F1 startup warning. IR optical emitters remain inhibited.

Source commit: d3dd05299ff8 (diff against 52f2c29b0a60).
Assisted-by: AI agents (Codex, Claude) under the author's direction
